(5641427, 820018, 104537, '<td valign="top">Very cute</td>', 'Very cute', '2009-09-09 03:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5641459, 820195, 103032, '<td valign="top">10.  This is the quintessential "going back to school" shot; school buses, kids scampering off to class.  I like the motion blur for that "frenzied" hurried feel.  The fresh rain was a plus for you in adding some decent reflection.  Personally, I like the tilt for lining up the buses on the top of the frame. Nice composition.  With that said, you must know how fickle the DPC crowd can be, so I''m thinking some voters may not like the tilt and may not like the blur.  I''m hoping for this to ribbon, my favorite of this challenge.</td>', '10.  This is the quintessential "going back to school" shot; school buses, kids scampering off to class.  I like the motion blur for that "frenzied" hurried feel.  The fresh rain was a plus for you in adding some decent reflection.  Personally, I like the tilt for lining up the buses on the top of the frame. Nice composition.  With that said, you must know how fickle the DPC crowd can be, so I''m thinking some voters may not like the tilt and may not like the blur.  I''m hoping for this to ribbon, my favorite of this challenge.', '2009-09-09 03:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5641478, 819893, 54645, '<td valign="top">Great perspective. Detail is excellent.</td>', 'Great perspective. Detail is excellent.', '2009-09-09 04:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5641479, 820165, 54645, '<td valign="top">Great moment. Lacking in contrast, but I like the moment and composition.</td>', 'Great moment. Lacking in contrast, but I like the moment and composition.', '2009-09-09 04:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5641480, 820097, 54645, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the fingers!?! I''ll look forward to the details.</td>', 'I don''t get the fingers!?! I''ll look forward to the details.', '2009-09-09 04:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5641482, 818941, 54645, '<td valign="top">"First Billy''s pocket, now a desk! Should have left me for the swimming teacher!"</td>', '"First Billy''s pocket, now a desk! Should have left me for the swimming teacher!"', '2009-09-09 04:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5641487, 819831, 103032, '<td valign="top">Spent a bit of time trying to figure out what I like and didn''t like about this photo.  It immediately drew me into it as "back to school", the first game of the season.  I like that the players on the field are "highlighted" and the rest of the scene fades to the background.  At first I didn''t like that the players were such a small part of the photo, but the more time I''m looking at it, the more I like the "scale" because this is what I imagine what I would see from the far sideline.  With that said, I think you may get dinged by the DPC crowd for the square crop, the negative space above the players, the images being dark, and on the technicals.  For me the subject overcomes these critiques.  Good luck on the challenge.</td>', 'Spent a bit of time trying to figure out what I like and didn''t like about this photo.  It immediately drew me into it as "back to school", the first game of the season.  I like that the players on the field are "highlighted" and the rest of the scene fades to the background.  At first I didn''t like that the players were such a small part of the photo, but the more time I''m looking at it, the more I like the "scale" because this is what I imagine what I would see from the far sideline.  With that said, I think you may get dinged by the DPC crowd for the square crop, the negative space above the players, the images being dark, and on the technicals.  For me the subject overcomes these critiques.  Good luck on the challenge.', '2009-09-09 04:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5641490, 820155, 63503, '<td valign="top">I think it may have been better without the border.</td>', 'I think it may have been better without the border.', '2009-09-09 04:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
