(5641512, 820031, 49109, '<td valign="top">This looks perfectly like a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=52549" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">IreneM</a> setup. Excellent focus, clarity and lighting. You should have cloned out the trademark in the reflection, too. - 9</td>', 'This looks perfectly like a  IreneM setup. Excellent focus, clarity and lighting. You should have cloned out the trademark in the reflection, too. - 9', '2009-09-09 05:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
