(5643229, 819765, 79079, '<td valign="top">AWESOME!  Is this the <a href="//www.pinestrawhs.org/schoolhouse.html" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Historic Schoolhouse</a> in Strawberry, AZ?  My wife and I were just there a couple weeks ago (it''s also a virtual geocache).  I wish I could have made the trip back up to shoot for this challenge!<br/> <br/>Brilliant entry -- hope it makes the first page; one of my favorities in this challenge for sure -- especially since I think I was just there recently!  ;)</td>', 'AWESOME!  Is this the Historic Schoolhouse in Strawberry, AZ?  My wife and I were just there a couple weeks ago (it''s also a virtual geocache).  I wish I could have made the trip back up to shoot for this challenge! Brilliant entry -- hope it makes the first page; one of my favorities in this challenge for sure -- especially since I think I was just there recently!  ;)', '2009-09-10 14:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5643230, 820039, 83313, '<td valign="top">Seems very much a snapshot I''m afraid. The subject seems pushed to far over at the edge of the frame and the harsh midday lighting is working against it. There are a few editing tricks that might be able to help with those bright highlights. Some careful use of curves, or some burning, perhaps. I would probably try some adjustments on a duplicate layer, since this is advanced editing, that would be allowable.</td>', 'Seems very much a snapshot I''m afraid. The subject seems pushed to far over at the edge of the frame and the harsh midday lighting is working against it. There are a few editing tricks that might be able to help with those bright highlights. Some careful use of curves, or some burning, perhaps. I would probably try some adjustments on a duplicate layer, since this is advanced editing, that would be allowable.', '2009-09-10 14:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5643233, 819831, 83313, '<td valign="top">The light pole is a major eye grabber that pulls me away form the main subject. Not sure if cloning that item out would be within challenge rules or not. Otherwise, I like this and it tells an all too common tale.</td>', 'The light pole is a major eye grabber that pulls me away form the main subject. Not sure if cloning that item out would be within challenge rules or not. Otherwise, I like this and it tells an all too common tale.', '2009-09-10 14:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5643239, 819890, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks good, but it seems to be not as crisp and clear as it should be, so I looked at the file size. At only 31k, you have a lot of JPEG compression going on here. Compression kills detail. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (200k for this one)<br/> <br/>Most likely I will be the only compression-anal person to see that!</td>', 'Looks good, but it seems to be not as crisp and clear as it should be, so I looked at the file size. At only 31k, you have a lot of JPEG compression going on here. Compression kills detail. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (200k for this one) Most likely I will be the only compression-anal person to see that!', '2009-09-10 14:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5643243, 820200, 83313, '<td valign="top">I see a copier inside the window. Extra points for that from the resident copier tech. (Looks like a Canon, judging from the appearance of the document feeder.)</td>', 'I see a copier inside the window. Extra points for that from the resident copier tech. (Looks like a Canon, judging from the appearance of the document feeder.)', '2009-09-10 14:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
