(5643250, 819229, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks like an average snapshot, I''m afraid. A couple of things that could help:<br/>-A stronger perspective view, using a <a href="//www.photocritic.org/the-rule-of-thirds/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">rule of thirds</a> composition.<br/>-Correct the slight tilt<br/>-Image looks flat, some levels or curves adjustments can fix that.<br/>-Some people in the shot could give it some more interest.</td>', 'Looks like an average snapshot, I''m afraid. A couple of things that could help:-A stronger perspective view, using a rule of thirds composition.-Correct the slight tilt-Image looks flat, some levels or curves adjustments can fix that.-Some people in the shot could give it some more interest.', '2009-09-10 14:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
