(5648440, 820051, 86447, '<td valign="top">I love their smiles!   The image seems a bit dingy... could use some brightening and/or contrast, maybe.  Also, the expression on the girl on the left is not attractive with her cutting her eyes to the corner like that.  I know it''s hard to control expressions, but in a photography contest, some will call this a ''snapshot'' instead of a photograph for a contest.   I''ve heard it time and again.<br/> <br/>It''s a happy photo and it makes me smile.  So, points for that!  :)  (not voting)</td>', 'I love their smiles!   The image seems a bit dingy... could use some brightening and/or contrast, maybe.  Also, the expression on the girl on the left is not attractive with her cutting her eyes to the corner like that.  I know it''s hard to control expressions, but in a photography contest, some will call this a ''snapshot'' instead of a photograph for a contest.   I''ve heard it time and again. It''s a happy photo and it makes me smile.  So, points for that!  :)  (not voting)', '2009-09-15 18:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
