(5650341, 819130, 45651, '<td valign="top">I should have had him in a glass jar or pined to a dissection board. Or even better had him sitting on a handful of colored pencils with an apple and some books with a school bus in the backgroud, I forgot all the cliche elements I wasn''t being very creative ;-)</td>', 'I should have had him in a glass jar or pined to a dissection board. Or even better had him sitting on a handful of colored pencils with an apple and some books with a school bus in the backgroud, I forgot all the cliche elements I wasn''t being very creative ;-)', '2009-09-16 19:29:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(5650342, 820195, 66635, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful!</td>', 'This is wonderful!', '2009-09-16 19:30:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(5650352, 819130, 28322, '<td valign="top">First of all I gave this a 7. <br/>Please note DPC is not only an American community, there are people here from all over the world, people whom their science classes doesn''t include animals, only books, projectors and maybe computers. <br/>What do you think a frog on a flower would present to them? A frog on a flower :) not related to schools at all. <br/>There is a huge space here to think it is a shoehorn. <br/>It is a point of view, thats said, I think it is a wonderful picture, great macro and lighting .. again, I gave it 7. <br/>Cheers,</td>', 'First of all I gave this a 7. Please note DPC is not only an American community, there are people here from all over the world, people whom their science classes doesn''t include animals, only books, projectors and maybe computers. What do you think a frog on a flower would present to them? A frog on a flower :) not related to schools at all. There is a huge space here to think it is a shoehorn. It is a point of view, thats said, I think it is a wonderful picture, great macro and lighting .. again, I gave it 7. Cheers,', '2009-09-16 19:52:08.000000', NULL, 0),
