(5651482, 820195, 66384, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on this marvelous entry and for the well deserved ribbon. You really captured the back to school chaos and, as you said in the title, frenzy. I''m so glad the voters liked it. And the real miracle is a blurred photo with no low votes at all.</td>', 'Congratulations on this marvelous entry and for the well deserved ribbon. You really captured the back to school chaos and, as you said in the title, frenzy. I''m so glad the voters liked it. And the real miracle is a blurred photo with no low votes at all.', '2009-09-17 15:35:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(5651747, 819828, 106806, '<td valign="top">hmmmmmm..... now an multiple exposure putting a man walking on water is one thing but your picture is another. Still the rules are rules and in this case very clear. But all the same I still think this is a cracking good photo both in execution and connection to the challenge. (sorry hope not gabbling but just had a band rehearsal and so a little tipsy)</td>', 'hmmmmmm..... now an multiple exposure putting a man walking on water is one thing but your picture is another. Still the rules are rules and in this case very clear. But all the same I still think this is a cracking good photo both in execution and connection to the challenge. (sorry hope not gabbling but just had a band rehearsal and so a little tipsy)', '2009-09-17 19:14:50.000000', NULL, 0),
