(5653328, 820195, 69008, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your new ribbon, and like <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=66384" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">JuliBoc</a> said, it great that DPC voters are finally getting comfortable with some blur in challenge shots.  This is an exceptional creation and well presented.  It captures the spirit of the morning, even the rain helps.</td>', 'Congrats on your new ribbon, and like  JuliBoc said, it great that DPC voters are finally getting comfortable with some blur in challenge shots.  This is an exceptional creation and well presented.  It captures the spirit of the morning, even the rain helps.', '2009-09-18 23:26:48.000000', NULL, 0),
