(5701681, 820035, 53814, '<td valign="top">You managed to capture the decisive moment and included all the elements necessary to complete the story. The dark future and the secure, ordered past... I don''t know how this could be improved.</td>', 'You managed to capture the decisive moment and included all the elements necessary to complete the story. The dark future and the secure, ordered past... I don''t know how this could be improved.', '2009-10-26 23:58:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(5762664, 819537, 109941, '<td valign="top">It''s just a shot at adding a photo on my first attempt. It''s trying to show that nerds too can be cool? Wearing the tie with not top can show how you can let your hair down and still be a good student? I dont really know. I just added it tbh. and the writing says "dead pretty"</td>', 'It''s just a shot at adding a photo on my first attempt. It''s trying to show that nerds too can be cool? Wearing the tie with not top can show how you can let your hair down and still be a good student? I dont really know. I just added it tbh. and the writing says "dead pretty"', '2009-12-10 05:03:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(5940466, 818954, 52336, '<td valign="top">It scored low, but I''m fond of this... it''s simple and well laid out in the frame, and unlike the others commenters, I think the shadow line at the bottom is a kind of nice counter-balance to the darker background at top, and the band of black shadow up there.</td>', 'It scored low, but I''m fond of this... it''s simple and well laid out in the frame, and unlike the others commenters, I think the shadow line at the bottom is a kind of nice counter-balance to the darker background at top, and the band of black shadow up there.', '2010-04-11 19:36:35.000000', NULL, 0);
